        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Subsequent Shadows: The Szuper Kokó Site",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112691010767",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f559fd89-0c3f-4e8c-aa84-a9de98b0f9d3).Image",
        "Description": "Adam, following your success with the submarine, we discovered a construction site crucial to the cartel&apos;s operations, where they are expanding their szuper kokó production. One guard, the cartel&apos;s chief enforcer, poses a significant threat. Known for his brutality and loyalty, his elimination is essential. Your objective is to infiltrate the site, eliminate him and the engineers, sabotaging their work. Escape by stealing a villager&apos;s scooter or boat. I will leave you to prepare!",
